<title>USA: TABLE - First Maryland Bancorp sell $200 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>TABLE - First Maryland Bancorp sell $200 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from First Maryland Bancorp was priced on Friday via lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co, according to a spokeswoman for the underwriter.</p>
<p>BORROWER FIRST MARYLAND BANCORP</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.20 PCT   MATURITY 7/1/07</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.943  FIRST PAY DATE 1/1/98</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 7.208 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD +76 BPS    CALLABLE NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1662))</p>
</text>
